// trigger.storyarc
// part of Arcturus, a programming language and compiler for the Infocom Z-machine.
// Copyright (c) 2026, Stefan Vogt.
// https://github.com/ByteProject/Arcturus
//
// A showcase for the trigger marker (docs/01 chapter 14): a `words` entry with
// a leading # is ordinary vocabulary AND the object's trigger, the word that
// says what the thing IS. Generous synonym lists are good declaration practice,
// and they are where matching ties come from: here the sea chest answers to
// "crate" as a synonym, so OPEN CRATE would tie and ask "Which do you mean"
// about a phrase that already named its object. The trigger settles exactly
// that tie: among tied candidates, the one whose trigger was typed wins
// silently. Two typed triggers still ask (a genuine question), zero typed
// triggers change nothing. A tiebreaker, never a gag order. Compile and run:
//
//   arcc examples/features/trigger.storyarc -o trigger.z5
//   frotz trigger.z5
//
// Try, in order:
//   open crate          both answer to "crate"; the trigger settles it silently
//   open box            no trigger typed: the honest question still happens
//   crate               and the answer narrows it, as always
//   take chest
//   open crate          the chest is in hand, yet the typed trigger still wins
//   put lens in crate   the second noun settles through the same matcher
//   open chest packing  a tie again, and the one typed trigger (chest) wins

game
    title  "The Hold"
    headline "A trigger showcase"
    author "Stefan Vogt"
    start  hold

room hold
    name "Cargo Hold"
    desc "Low beams, salt air, and two containers lashed to the deck: a
          packing crate and an old sea chest."

// The crate's trigger is its own name: whoever types "crate" means this one,
// however many other things answer to the word as a synonym.
thing crate of container in hold
    name "packing crate"
    words #crate, packing, box
    openable

// The chest generously answers to "crate" and "box" too, as a real game
// would declare it; its own trigger is "chest".
thing chest of container in hold
    name "sea chest"
    words #chest, sea, crate, box
    openable

thing lens in hold
    name "signal lens"
    words lens, signal
